# The Tauri desktop app (source + Rust build artifacts) has nothing to do
# with the Next.js web app Vercel deploys — including it (src-tauri/target
# alone runs several GB of compiled Rust output) blew past Vercel's upload
# file-count/size limits. See desktop-app/.gitignore, which doesn't cover
# src-tauri/target since that folder was never meant to leave the desktop
# build machine in the first place.
desktop-app

